00:02:39.683 --> 00:02:42.203
Novig is the volume story Fortune put third.

00:02:42.823 --> 00:02:48.783
Using the PM-Pulse newsletter and data from Aldrin, Fortune said Novig handled $1.8 billion

00:02:48.783 --> 00:02:57.063
