00:02:57.063 --> 00:03:04.323
at Polymarket US, roughly $300 million ahead of crypto.com, and 80% above Novig's own prior

00:03:04.323 --> 00:03:05.103
30 days.

00:03:05.103 --> 00:03:10.523
Sam Schwartz, who runs that newsletter, warns the tally leaves out combos, which can

00:03:10.523 --> 00:03:13.543
