00:03:14.003 --> 00:03:19.623
The company started in 2021 on a sweepstakes model, then opened as a federally regulated

00:03:19.623 --> 00:03:20.583
market in August.

00:03:21.203 --> 00:03:25.823
A $75 million series B in February priced it at $500 million.

00:03:26.383 --> 00:03:31.723
